{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run a <strong>relaxing</strong> plant nursery, manage inventory, and turn a small shop into a thriving business at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Store Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design your shop layout, stock shelves with plants and supplies, and create an inviting space for customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474700/extras/Shot01_StockingV2.gif?t=1743051860\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Order Goods</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your computer to purchase plants, seeds, and gardening tools, then set prices to maximize profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474700/extras/Shot02_ComputerPurchase.gif?t=1743051860\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Checkout Customers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scan items, process cash and card payments, and keep the line moving to satisfy shoppers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474700/extras/Shot04_10_CashRegister.gif?t=1743051860\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gardening</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grow your own crops from seeds in greenhouses, harvest them, and sell for an even bigger profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474700/extras/Shot06_GardeningV2.gif?t=1743051860\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Grow</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reinvest earnings to expand your store, upgrade equipment, and unlock new plant varieties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474700/extras/Shot05_Expansion.gif?t=1743051860\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Automate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hire staff to handle sales and plant care while you focus on growing your business empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474700/extras/Shot09_CustomerShoppingWithNPC.gif?t=1743051860\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unwind, strategize, and cultivate the perfect nursery in <strong>Plant Nursery Simulator</strong>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3474700?t=1743051860","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3474700?t=1743051860","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474700/1c2904bfac4d3f9caf4e5888080d7c3392a7b989/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743051860","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474700/1c2904bfac4d3f9caf4e5888080d7c3392a7b989/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743051860","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3510670,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run a <strong>relaxing</strong> plant nursery, manage inventory, and turn a small shop into a thriving business at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Store Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design your shop layout, stock shelves with plants and supplies, and create an inviting space for customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474700/extras/Shot01_StockingV2.gif?t=1743051860\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Order Goods</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">U